## 6. 统一 YAML Schema

所有生成的 Markdown 文件必须有 frontmatter：

```yaml
---
type: course
status: processing
course: ""
lesson: ""
source_type: video
source_path: ""
evidence_id: ""
confidence: medium
review_level: new
difficulty: 1
priority: 1
created: 2026-07-01
updated: 2026-07-01
tags:
  - course
  - knowledgeos
aliases: []
links:
  concepts: []
  methods: []
  cases: []
cssclasses:
  - dashboard
  - course-home
---
```

### type 可选值

```text
course
lesson
concept
method
case
review
task
evidence
visual
report
pending
```

### status 可选值

```text
inbox
processing
converted
verified
review
done
archived
blocked
```

### confidence 可选值

```text
high
medium
low
unknown
```

### review_level 可选值

```text
new
learning
familiar
mastered
```

