## 7. 课程主页模板要求

`templates/course-home.md` 必须包含：

```markdown
---
type: course
status: processing
course: "{{course}}"
created: "{{date}}"
updated: "{{date}}"
cssclasses:
  - dashboard
  - course-home
tags:
  - course
  - knowledgeos
---

# {{course}}

> [!summary] 课程概览
> - 状态：`=this.status`
> - 进度：`=this.progress`
> - 核验：`=this.confidence`
> - 待审核：见下方待确认区

## 1. 今日入口

- [ ] 继续整理本课
- [ ] 复习知识卡片
- [ ] 处理待人工确认
- [ ] 生成项目行动

## 2. 课程地图

![[01_课程地图.canvas]]

## 3. 核心概念

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
file.link AS 概念,
confidence AS 可信度,
review_level AS 复习等级
FROM "{{course_path}}/03_知识卡片"
WHERE type = "concept"
SORT priority ASC
```

## 4. 核心方法

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
file.link AS 方法,
difficulty AS 难度,
status AS 状态
FROM "{{course_path}}/03_知识卡片"
WHERE type = "method"
SORT priority ASC
```

## 5. 复习中心

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
file.link AS 复习卡,
review_level AS 等级,
difficulty AS 难度
FROM "{{course_path}}/04_复习卡片"
SORT updated DESC
```

## 6. 项目行动

```dataview
TASK
FROM "{{course_path}}/06_项目行动"
WHERE !completed
```

## 7. 待人工确认

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
file.link AS 问题,
reason AS 原因,
source_path AS 来源
FROM "{{course_path}}"
WHERE status = "blocked" OR confidence = "low"
```

## 8. 导入报告

![[08_导入报告]]
```

