## 8. 知识卡片模板要求

`templates/concept-card.md`：

```markdown
---
type: concept
status: verified
course: "{{course}}"
lesson: "{{lesson}}"
source_type: "{{source_type}}"
source_path: "{{source_path}}"
evidence_id: "{{evidence_id}}"
confidence: "{{confidence}}"
review_level: new
difficulty: 1
priority: 1
created: "{{date}}"
updated: "{{date}}"
tags:
  - concept
  - knowledge-card
cssclasses:
  - knowledge-card
  - cards
---

# {{concept_name}}

> [!definition] 定义
> {{definition}}

> [!example] 例子
> {{example}}

> [!important] 为什么重要
> {{why_important}}

## 使用场景

{{use_cases}}

## 与其他概念的关系

- 相关概念：{{related_concepts}}
- 所属方法：{{related_methods}}
- 可落地项目：{{related_actions}}

## 证据来源

- 来源文件：`{{source_path}}`
- 证据编号：`{{evidence_id}}`
- 可信度：`{{confidence}}`

## 待人工确认

{{pending_review}}
```

