> [!question] 问题
> {{question}}

> [!answer] 答案
> {{answer}}

## 记忆线索

{{memory_hook}}

## 容易混淆

{{confusions}}

## 来源

- 课程：[[{{course}}]]
- 章节：[[{{lesson}}]]
- 证据：{{evidence_id}}
```

